2026-09-15 10:46:16.012 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: Our small enterprise is happy, because being together makes every day bright.  
We plan an ongoing market day, and our enterprise wants to attract many friendly people.  
