2026-09-15 10:48:05.225 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: Our small enterprise was happy this morning, with the sun being bright over the market.  
We worked on an ongoing stall, trying to attract more people with fresh bread and tea.  
I felt happy being there, even when little problems became entangled with our plans.  
