2026-09-15 10:50:44.810 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:244 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: At our small enterprise, the morning began happy, with everyone being ready to work.  
The garden outside our enterprise had bright flowers, and they attract birds every day.  
I felt happy being there, even when I was entangled with many small tasks.  
Our ongoing work in the enterprise kept us busy, but we stayed happy together.  
